  "sourceFindings": [
    "OnTransferHero reads the arriving map configuration, so departing-map transfer=false must not erase raw hero companion fields",
    "Only the departing map campaignTransfer+bannerFree flags and positive style write the source banner INI",
    "New-map initialization resets companion progression when transfer is disabled and initializes that map free-banner choice, including heroes without a companion",
    "The importedFromCampaign marker is construction metadata and is deliberately absent from the existing binary save layout"
  ],
